\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Abide among us with Thy grace,
\par LordJesus, evermore,
\par Nor let us e'er to sin give place,
\par Nor grieve Him we adore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Abide among us with Thy word;
\par Redeemer whom we love;
\par Thy help and mercy here afford,
\par And life with Thee above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Abide among us with Thy ray,
\par O Light that lighten'st all,
\par And let Thy truth preserve our way,
\par Nor suffer us to all. 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Abide with us to bless us still,
\par O bounteous Lord of peace;
\par With grace and power our spirits fill,
\par Our faith and love increase.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Abide among us as our shield,
\par O Captain of Thy host,
\par That to the world we may not yield,
\par Nor e'er forsake our post.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Abide with us in faithful love,
\par Our God and Saviour be;
\par Thy help in need, O let us prove,
\par And keep us true to Thee.
\par                               Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

